  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>Staging audit: total_rows_count = raw_* count, success_rows_count = stg_* count (clean rows), failed_rows_count = raw - stg.
etl_extraction_control.rows_extracted = success_rows_count (accepted rows).
started_at comes from ETL_STARTED_AT JVM variable (set by 00_start_etl_source_to_staging).
LSET/CET watermark update pattern:
  Raw keeps the full source file.
  Raw-to-staging window: event_ts &gt;= (LSET_* - LookbackDays) AND event_ts &lt;= CET_*.
  LookbackDays defaults to 3 for trips and NOAA; it does not move the committed watermark backward.
  After success: control.lset = control.cet = CET_* (this run end).
  Next run therefore starts after this CET. Re-bootstrap sample files: reset control.lset to 2026-01-01 00:00:00.</note>
